to our foundation's prestigious university.

105
00:07:28,223 --> 00:07:32,060
Now, I will explain
the training evaluation method.

106
00:07:32,060 --> 00:07:33,645
After practice each day,

107
00:07:33,645 --> 00:07:36,606
the cameras installed around this gym

108
00:07:36,606 --> 00:07:40,569
will automatically collect
your training data.

109
00:07:40,569 --> 00:07:42,529
Based on those calculated metrics,

110
00:07:42,529 --> 00:07:45,949
you will be assigned

111
00:07:45,949 --> 00:07:48,368
one of three grades: A, B, or C.

112
00:07:48,952 --> 00:07:52,038
There's only one thing
you'll see on the scorecard:

113
00:07:52,038 --> 00:07:54,958
whether you're an A, B,

114
00:07:54,958 --> 00:07:57,143
or a C, which puts you at risk of elimination.

115
00:07:57,419 --> 00:08:00,463
If a trainee receives a grade C
three times in a row,

116
00:08:01,256 --> 00:08:02,882
they will be dismissed immediately.

117
00:08:03,925 --> 00:08:07,696
Since this camp is run
as a group training program,

118
00:08:07,696 --> 00:08:09,848
using this gym outside of regular practice hours

119
00:08:09,848 --> 00:08:13,284
is strictly forbidden.

120
00:08:13,852 --> 00:08:16,688
Coming early in the morning to train alone,

121
00:08:16,688 --> 00:08:19,441
or staying behind after practice,

122
00:08:19,441 --> 00:08:21,067
are all violations of the rules.

123
00:08:21,818 --> 00:08:24,154
Break a rule, and you lose points immediately.

124
00:08:24,154 --> 00:08:26,548
Get caught twice, and you're dismissed.

125
00:08:26,740 --> 00:08:27,616
Keep that in mind.

126
00:08:29,910 --> 00:08:32,037
And do you see that storage room in the back?

127
00:08:34,122 --> 00:08:38,501
That's where the equipment
for recording training data is kept.

128
00:08:38,501 --> 00:08:43,173
So regular trainees are strictly prohibited
from entering.

129
00:08:43,173 --> 00:08:46,468
Unauthorized entry means double the penalty.

130
00:08:46,468 --> 00:08:49,054
Of course, there are no exceptions.

131
00:08:50,055 --> 00:08:51,765
For this camp,

132
00:08:51,765 --> 00:08:53,992
