Stir-fried sausages, seaweed soup, and gimbap.

179
00:14:29,769 --> 00:14:31,020
My bad, my bad.

180
00:15:12,770 --> 00:15:13,980
My bad, my bad.

181
00:15:49,265 --> 00:15:50,366
You're back?

182
